|> Exercise
    handle=_difference_quotient_nutshell_

    Just to make sure we're all on the same
    page, and recapping Note >>_difference_quotient_limit_
    of Exercise >>_difference_quotient_illustration_, can you
    say, in a nutshell, what a difference quotient is good for?

    |> Solution

        “Approximating the slope of the tangent to a function
        $f : \rr \ra \rr$ at a point $x \in \rr$.”